; Permanent-failure diagnostic reason.
;   1 = repeated construction watchdog timeout
;
; The current build rules do not establish a prerequisite-blocked or
; builder-starved cause, so those states are intentionally not claimed.
(defconst bt-castle-prereq-reason-timeout 1)
